{"seq":25,"slug":"web-components","title":"Web Components 与原生组件","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Web Components 与原生组件\n\n浏览器自带一套构建可复用 UI 单元的标准能力，不依赖任何框架——这就是 Web Components。它由三块互相独立又彼此咬合的规范组成：自定义元素让你向 HTML 词汇表注册新标签，Shadow DOM 给元素一个与外界隔离的内部 DOM 与样式作用域，`<template>` 与 `<slot>` 则负责把惰性结构和外部内容编排进来。三者都已在 Chrome、Firefox、Safari、Edge 上达到通用支持，2026 年的全球可用性约 98.7%，并随 Declarative Shadow DOM、ElementInternals 这些后续能力进入真正可用于生产的阶段。\n\n这个 hub 按「地基→骨架→工程→落地」四章层层递进，刻意让每个概念只在它的主章深讲一次，其余地方点到即止并交叉链接，避免读者在重复叙述里打转。\n\n第一章「基础」铺设地基。先用一篇概览交代三大支柱的分工、历史脉络与适用边界，再分别深入自定义元素的注册机制与 Shadow DOM 的封装树。读完这一章，你能写出一个最小但完整的原生组件。\n\n第二章「模板与样式」搭建骨架。`<template>` 与 `<slot>` 决定组件如何接纳外部内容，样式封装规范（`:host`、`::part`、CSS 自定义属性）决定外观如何在隔离与可定制之间取得平衡，生命周期回调则决定组件在被插入、移除、属性变化时如何响应。这三者共同构成组件的「形与时」。\n\n第三章「工程」把单个组件推向真实项目。属性与特性的双向映射、自定义事件、ElementInternals 表单参与构成组件的对外契约；随后是与 React 19、Vue、Angular 的互操作；最后是 Lit——目前最主流的 Web Components 库，它用响应式属性与声明式模板抹平原生 API 的样板。\n\n第四章「实践」收口落地。设计系统如何用原生组件做跨框架分发与主题化，SSR 如何借 Declarative Shadow DOM 实现首屏免 JS，以及可访问性与性能这两条贯穿始终的工程红线。读完四章，你不仅会写组件，更知道如何把它安全、高效、可维护地交付到生产。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"web-components-overview","title":"Web Components 概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/foundations/web-components-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"custom-elements","title":"自定义元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/foundations/custom-elements"},{"seq":3,"slug":"shadow-dom","title":"Shadow DOM 影子文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/foundations/shadow-dom"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"templates","title":"模板与样式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/templates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"html-templates-slots","title":"HTML 模板与 slot","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/templates/html-templates-slots"},{"seq":2,"slug":"styling-encapsulation","title":"样式封装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/templates/styling-encapsulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lifecycle","title":"生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/templates/lifecycle"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-events","title":"状态与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/engineering/state-events"},{"seq":2,"slug":"framework-interop","title":"与框架互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/engineering/framework-interop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"libraries-lit","title":"库：Lit","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/engineering/libraries-lit"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-systems-wc","title":"设计系统与组件库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/practice/design-systems-wc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ssr-web-components","title":"SSR 与 Web Components","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/practice/ssr-web-components"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accessibility-perf","title":"可访问性与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-components/practice/accessibility-perf"}]}]}